There are 6 ECTS for this course (= 168 sbu): 36 hours for classes, 20 hours for preparing the exam, and 12 hours for preparing the presentation. This leaves 100 hours for literature study (calculating with 6 pages per hour, 600 pages in the preparation for the classes).

